--- !u!1001 &1280170039
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1065650978}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: convo.myName
      value: Muktuk
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'managedReferences[-2]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: convo.sentences.Array.size
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Hmm\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "The tides shift, the winds whisper\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: and here you are.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: Muktuk feels something is wrong, a tremor in the water, a taste of unease
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'And if the sea is restless, the world will soon follow. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[5]'
      value: You have just begun, but the strong currents already pull you towards
        something greater.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[6]'
      value: 'Oh, Muktuk completely forgot to do a proper introduction. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[7]'
      value: Muktuk is Muktuk!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[8]'
      value: "The Wise whale, Wanderer of the seas, Plankton specialist\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[9]'
      value: but today Muktuk will also be your guide.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[10]'
      value: 'Something tells Muktuk you should see the god of sweetness. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[11]'
      value: But first muktuk will give you something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[12]'
      value: 'A good journey needs a good map, take this! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[13]'
      value: Muktuk feels generous today, so here is one more gift.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[14]'
      value: If you ever are lost or in need of some wisdom, call to Muktuk.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[15]'
      value: The sea will carry your voice and muktuk will answer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convo.sentences.Array.data[16]'
      value: The sea will carry your voice and muktuk will answer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: convos.Array.data[0].quest.questName
      value: Give Food
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5156321257078834657, guid: d7da8ae046aea4e4cb4866811f79cf0f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'managedReferences[4381414843323514955]'
